  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isa 3",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olong'oling'oli te Yerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura, ore Olaitoriani, Olaitoriani loo lororani, naa keiwuang'ie te Yerusalem o te Yuda, ina naisiligi o ina naishuyieki, eneisiligi te ndaa o nkare; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilo tung'ani magilani o sikari, o larishani o loiboni le Nkai, o laitumusumusoni o lpayian, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilo arikoni le njore e onom o ilo tung'ani oata enkitoo, ilo arikoni o ilo arriyia too nkitoduaat, o ilo arriyia te naibon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kaitaa nanu ilayiok ilkituaak lenye, naa nkera naapuo aaitore ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kepuo iltung'ana aaibookino enkop maate, neitorogony ake oltung'ani olikae oltung'ani ake ole latia enye; neitokoos olbarnoti te dukuya olpayian, neitokoos oltung'ani li abori te dukuya ilo kitok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kelotu enkata naibung oltung'ani olalashe lenye ti atua enkaji e menye, ejo, “Iata iyie olkila; iyie olo aaku olarikoni lang, ore ele sototi pooki le nkidaata naa keaku abori enkitoria ino;” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore te ina olong naa keiro ninye ajo, “Maaku nanu olabaani, ore atua enkaji ai metii endaa nemetii olkila; mikintaa intae nanu olarikoni loo ltung'ana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu etarrorre Yerusalem, netabatate Yuda; enkaraki naa ore nkirorot enye o nkiaasin enye negilunore Olaitoriani, nemor dukuya nkonyek enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilo kep lenye oishakenoki ninche; keibalunye ninche ing'ok enye anaa Sodom, meisudoo ninche. Woi ninche Amu eyautua entorroni shumata ate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiaaki lelo asipak nchere aisidain mbaa ti alo ninche, amu keinos ninche ilng'anayio loo nkiaasin enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woi ilo tung'ani torrono! Kerruoyo mbaa te ninye, amu ore enaba anaa enataasa nkaik enyena, ina eyookini aaitaas ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too ltung'ana laainei, nkera naaitorogony ninche, naa nkituaak naaitore ninche. Lo tung'ana laainei, eitapong'oitie intae ilarikok linyi, nemil enkoitoi inyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eiguanare Olaitoriani iltung'ana lenyena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eitasho Olaitoriani pee eishankarra, eitasho pee eiguanare iltung'ana lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etijing'a Olaitoriani enkiguana aiguanare ilpayiani o lkituaak loo ltung'ana lenyena: “Intae apa ooinosa enkurma oo lng'anayio, ore nena nitoorutuo intae ilaisinak netii atua nkajijik inyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kainyoo intodolulu pee intorogonyonyo iltung'ana laainei, nindong'idong'o aarepeny nkomomi e lelo aisinak?” Olaitoriani loo lororani ojo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkikoo too nkituaak e Yerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etejo Olaitoriani: Ore enkaraki naitokoos ntoyie e Sion nepuo te nkitaragirag neing'orisho to lwuasa, neyagiyag epuoito eipidie nkejek enye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "keosh Olaitoriani to lpepedoi nena lukuny oo ntoyie e Sion, naa keibalunye Olaitoriani emasipaisho enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore kenya te ina olong naa keiwuang'ie Olaitoriani nena masaa naang'idare, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o lmiintoni, o lkataarri o nkarash oo murto; o nkarash ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo lukuny, o sekenke oo nkaik, o ntoren, o ltuleta le sonkoyo, o ntaleng'o ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o lelo giso oomishira o lgiso loo nkumeishin; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o lelo kilani loo siruai, lelo karash li oriong, o lelo kilani, o lbenia loo nkaik; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o lelo kilani oobebek, o lelo kilani oo puyiapui, o nkarash oo lukuny, o lelo karash oo imulumulieki nkonyek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te rishata e rropili naa eng'uan; ore te rishata e nkimeita naa olgosoi; naa ore te rishata oo lpapit ooitobiraki, naa enkurroto; naa ore te rishata o olkila sidai naa enkishopo oo lkuniyiani; naa ore te rishata e nkikishaan naa enkurruna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilewa linyi naa kebatat olalem nemuta lelo lewa linyi magil to larrabal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nchomito enyena neyietu aaishir; neirrag ninye te nkop meishopo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
